{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"poem-black-star-rising","version":1,"title":"Black Star Rising (a poem)","ageTiers":["9-10"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"On the sixth of March, in fifty-seven,\nThe morning rose like gold;\nA people stood in the Accra heat\nAnd a new tale began to unfold.","sentences":["On the sixth of March, in fifty-seven,\nThe morning rose like gold;\nA people stood in the Accra heat\nAnd a new tale began to unfold."],"alt":"A crowd gathers in Accra at sunrise under a golden sky.","image":{"hash":"sha256:cb9a300791f9532fce8abf538cd8970098a170995fd734c85458558aa31bdb14","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:d314d02cf53b71ed6ce6f16b92fe827d32964240a4e429f4880441f0def3e08f","durationMs":17560,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,17560]],"words":[[0,331],[331,828],[828,1656],[1656,1987],[1987,2981],[2981,3312],[3312,5300],[5300,5797],[5797,6957],[6957,7620],[7620,8283],[8283,9111],[9111,9277],[9277,10271],[10271,11099],[11099,11430],[11430,11927],[11927,12755],[12755,13418],[13418,13915],[13915,14081],[14081,14578],[14578,15241],[15241,16069],[16069,16400],[16400,17560]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Red for the blood of those who fought,\nGold for the wealth in the ground,\nGreen for the forest and the farm,\nA Black Star for Africa, safe and sound.","sentences":["Red for the blood of those who fought,\nGold for the wealth in the ground,\nGreen for the forest and the farm,\nA Black Star for Africa, safe and sound."],"alt":"A flag in red, gold and green with a black star flutters in the wind.","image":{"hash":"sha256:81ba20858c90b2feea97ffbaeae5c2135fc09cc126b864faefc351dbb2c86531","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:7fe7552201c1f2c37c094230a93d3266b2f3c3a34efb91f0c74286e7f8e151ab","durationMs":18480,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,18480]],"words":[[0,462],[462,924],[924,1386],[1386,2156],[2156,2464],[2464,3234],[3234,3696],[3696,4774],[4774,5390],[5390,5852],[5852,6314],[6314,7238],[7238,7546],[7546,8008],[8008,9086],[9086,9856],[9856,10318],[10318,10780],[10780,11704],[11704,12166],[12166,12628],[12628,13398],[13398,13552],[13552,14322],[14322,14938],[14938,15400],[15400,16478],[16478,17094],[17094,17556],[17556,18480]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"The drums spoke loud across the crowd,\nThe flags danced in the breeze,\nAnd hope rose up like morning mist\nAbove the tall palm trees.","sentences":["The drums spoke loud across the crowd,\nThe flags danced in the breeze,\nAnd hope rose up like morning mist\nAbove the tall palm trees."],"alt":"Drummers play as flags wave above a crowd beneath palm trees.","image":{"hash":"sha256:748fa945a9751f93d336adbe517cbd64af2d3db0db133c0320a573e1bf9c7468","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:d2eb8a9c1f3f8576b97a9ea71e7c5cff62381a0984a29c9b410282b428852ca8","durationMs":15680,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,15680]],"words":[[0,436],[436,1162],[1162,1888],[1888,2469],[2469,3340],[3340,3776],[3776,4647],[4647,5083],[5083,5809],[5809,6680],[6680,6970],[6970,7406],[7406,8422],[8422,8858],[8858,9439],[9439,10020],[10020,10310],[10310,10891],[10891,11907],[11907,12488],[12488,13214],[13214,13650],[13650,14231],[14231,14812],[14812,15680]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"But freedom is not a finish line,\nIt is a road we walk;\nIt asks for hands that build and learn\nAnd honest words that talk.","sentences":["But freedom is not a finish line,\nIt is a road we walk;\nIt asks for hands that build and learn\nAnd honest words that talk."],"alt":"A long road crossing a green landscape with people walking and building.","image":{"hash":"sha256:85aef15b810c51a3af00aed6de242a9133cd800e3ea036999b83d998e45ed5f5","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:eafa75c535f836534a2c1a8fd8cc52bcdd2197b26b376254d4a5628be270d919","durationMs":15520,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,15520]],"words":[[0,480],[480,1600],[1600,1920],[1920,2400],[2400,2560],[2560,3520],[3520,4320],[4320,4640],[4640,4960],[4960,5120],[5120,5760],[5760,6080],[6080,6880],[6880,7200],[7200,7840],[7840,8320],[8320,9120],[9120,9760],[9760,10560],[10560,11040],[11040,11840],[11840,12320],[12320,13280],[13280,14080],[14080,14720],[14720,15520]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"So when you see the Black Star shine\nOn cloth, on arch, on field,\nRemember: light is something shared,\nAnd a nation is a shield.","sentences":["So when you see the Black Star shine\nOn cloth, on arch, on field,\nRemember: light is something shared,\nAnd a nation is a shield."],"alt":"A black star on a cloth, an arch and a football field, with a shield behind them.","image":{"hash":"sha256:c06c261f40f573b5fa2d1d27cc948c34e25f6a0c34bc5c914e0e4e6b82b2d16a","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:3acf77387b0fa7ab45a53a7d200d52620ce22d82fb1a60b7a3720fcabb8e7bb9","durationMs":18440,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,18440]],"words":[[0,355],[355,1064],[1064,1596],[1596,2128],[2128,2660],[2660,3547],[3547,4256],[4256,5143],[5143,5498],[5498,6562],[6562,6917],[6917,7804],[7804,8159],[8159,9223],[9223,10819],[10819,11706],[11706,12061],[12061,13657],[13657,14898],[14898,15430],[15430,15607],[15607,16671],[16671,17026],[17026,17203],[17203,18440]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"Rise, young Ghana, read and dream,\nBe a lantern in the night;\nThe star above the gate is yours—\nNow carry on its light.","sentences":["Rise, young Ghana, read and dream,\nBe a lantern in the night;\nThe star above the gate is yours—\nNow carry on its light."],"alt":"A young person holds a lantern at night beneath a large star over a gate.","image":{"hash":"sha256:9e80976634342d4dcbe36f56a0e001e3b03d84c404e46318c0dd6933ad228f28","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:b81a0eb6b6d8166841d74d2056077a56e34cfdc503a9e6183675dd0a21aa1afb","durationMs":14800,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,14800]],"words":[[0,771],[771,1542],[1542,2467],[2467,3084],[3084,3547],[3547,4472],[4472,4780],[4780,4934],[4934,6013],[6013,6321],[6321,6784],[6784,7709],[7709,8172],[8172,8789],[8789,9560],[9560,10023],[10023,10640],[10640,10948],[10948,11873],[11873,12336],[12336,13107],[13107,13415],[13415,13878],[13878,14800]]}}}],"activities":[{"id":"bs-c1","type":"comprehension","afterPage":2,"question":"According to the poem, what does gold stand for?","options":["The wealth in the ground","The sun","The forest"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"bs-c2","type":"comprehension","afterPage":3,"question":"Which figure of speech is “hope rose up like morning mist”?","options":["A simile","A metaphor","Hyperbole"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"It uses “like” to compare hope to mist."},{"id":"bs-c3","type":"comprehension","afterPage":4,"question":"What does “freedom is not a finish line, it is a road we walk” mean?","options":["Freedom needs continued effort","Freedom is easy","Freedom ends"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"This is a metaphor: freedom is compared to a road, showing it is ongoing."},{"id":"bs-ph","type":"phonics","afterPage":4,"targetSound":"alk","prompt":"In the fourth stanza, which two words rhyme?","options":["walk","talk","learn"],"correctIndexes":[0,1]},{"id":"bs-c4","type":"comprehension","afterPage":5,"question":"Which line is a metaphor?","options":["A nation is a shield","Like morning mist","Red for the blood"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"It says a nation is a shield without using like or as."},{"id":"bs-sel","type":"sel","afterPage":6,"prompt":"The last stanza asks young people to be lanterns. What can you do to be a light for your community?","feelingOptions":["Inspired","Proud","Determined","Hopeful"]}],"glossary":[{"word":"unfold","definition":"To open out slowly and be revealed.","pages":[1]},{"word":"wealth","definition":"A large amount of valuable things.","pages":[2]},{"word":"shield","definition":"Something that protects.","pages":[5]},{"word":"lantern","definition":"A lamp with a handle that gives light.","pages":[6]}],"assets":{"sha256:cb9a300791f9532fce8abf538cd8970098a170995fd734c85458558aa31bdb14":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/poem-black-star-rising/page1-1.webp","bytes":143908,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:d314d02cf53b71ed6ce6f16b92fe827d32964240a4e429f4880441f0def3e08f":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/d314d02cf53b.mp3","bytes":70700,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:81ba20858c90b2feea97ffbaeae5c2135fc09cc126b864faefc351dbb2c86531":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/poem-black-star-rising/page2-1.webp","bytes":119798,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:7fe7552201c1f2c37c094230a93d3266b2f3c3a34efb91f0c74286e7f8e151ab":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/7fe7552201c1.mp3","bytes":74348,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:748fa945a9751f93d336adbe517cbd64af2d3db0db133c0320a573e1bf9c7468":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/poem-black-star-rising/page3-1.webp","bytes":134556,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:d2eb8a9c1f3f8576b97a9ea71e7c5cff62381a0984a29c9b410282b428852ca8":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/d2eb8a9c1f3f.mp3","bytes":63212,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:85aef15b810c51a3af00aed6de242a9133cd800e3ea036999b83d998e45ed5f5":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/poem-black-star-rising/page4-1.webp","bytes":152764,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:eafa75c535f836534a2c1a8fd8cc52bcdd2197b26b376254d4a5628be270d919":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/eafa75c535f8.mp3","bytes":62540,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:c06c261f40f573b5fa2d1d27cc948c34e25f6a0c34bc5c914e0e4e6b82b2d16a":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/poem-black-star-rising/page5-1.webp","bytes":83532,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:3acf77387b0fa7ab45a53a7d200d52620ce22d82fb1a60b7a3720fcabb8e7bb9":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/3acf77387b0f.mp3","bytes":74252,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:9e80976634342d4dcbe36f56a0e001e3b03d84c404e46318c0dd6933ad228f28":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/poem-black-star-rising/page6-1.webp","bytes":86318,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:b81a0eb6b6d8166841d74d2056077a56e34cfdc503a9e6183675dd0a21aa1afb":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/b81a0eb6b6d8.mp3","bytes":59660,"type":"audio/mpeg"}},"contentHash":"sha256:d41d12519ffe1ea9a964bc74130bd4b3f76e94e6a318c80b477992f7cbe921ea"}